• New: Authenticator records — keep 2FA (TOTP) secrets in the vault and get live one-time codes beside the logins they protect. Add them by scanning a QR code or typing the key.
• Updates can now be downloaded inside the app, with a restart when you are ready.
• Changing or resetting the master password works again on Android 9 and 10.
• Restore refuses empty or newer-version backup files instead of wiping the vault.
• Smoother screen transitions and a smaller download.
